	"descriptionMarkdown": "Started this based on Nilaus's Space Age Let's Play video 6 where he builds the foundries on Vulcanus for producing basic materials, and I added the gas lines' production and one copper cables line. \n\nAll you need to do is:\n- connect: 2 lines of lava, one top right and one bottom right\n- connect sulfuric acid bottom right  \n- connect coal, calcite and tungsten ore on the right mid. \n\nIt will give you a very simple bus with: all the liquids, iron plate, copper plate, steel, tungsten carbide, gears, copper cable.  You can add more lines as needed and double some things up. \n\nNote: Use this for before coal liquefaction (the advanced one that you have to research with orange science). Once that's up, you can sub that in for creating the liquids if you'd like as Nilaus does in the video. \n\nHere's a link to the video if you'd like to watch it yourself. \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n9qDgEVWlYc&list=PLV3rF--heRVtEiOK1dCD912g9Jn8pG-QA&index=7\n\nEverything else should just work when you do this. Let me know if anything doesn't work or if you have any ideas for improvement. \n\nDee",
